# Stockfish-SR: Symbolic Regression Chess Engine Project

## Project Overview
Transform the current Stockfish chess engine to use symbolic regression (SR) for dynamic evaluation function optimization, enabling the engine to automatically improve through training.

## Project Goals
- Replace static NNUE evaluation with adaptive symbolic regression evaluation
- Implement automated training pipeline for evaluation function optimization
- Maintain or improve engine strength while adding self-improvement capabilities
- Create modular architecture for evaluation function evolution

